{"4443830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ResistanceZ", "steam_appid": 4443830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/c695ad0a57c691f49af00a3051bb6c3f.poster.avif?t=1787702704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/c695ad0a57c691f49af00a3051bb6c3f.webm?t=1787702704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/c695ad0a57c691f49af00a3051bb6c3f.mp4?t=1787702704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/t3?t=1787702704\" /></span>About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ResistanceZ</strong> is a co-op survival action horror game playable with up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players begin their fight for survival by parachuting from a plane onto a hostile island filled with enemies. From the moment you land, you must explore your surroundings and prepare for the dangers ahead. During loot phases, coordinating with your teammates to gather weapons, ammunition, and essential equipment is crucial for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real challenge begins when zombie waves arrive. As each wave grows increasingly difficult, you must build your defenses, manage your resources carefully, and protect one another. Without proper communication and teamwork, survival is impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only way off the island is a rescue helicopter. But until it arrives, you must hold your ground. Strengthen your defenses, secure your position, and survive until extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/488051701ec155a6008b7e63845d78d0.poster.avif?t=1787702704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/488051701ec155a6008b7e63845d78d0.webm?t=1787702704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/488051701ec155a6008b7e63845d78d0.mp4?t=1787702704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/c695ad0a57c691f49af00a3051bb6c3f.poster.avif?t=1787702704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/c695ad0a57c691f49af00a3051bb6c3f.webm?t=1787702704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/c695ad0a57c691f49af00a3051bb6c3f.mp4?t=1787702704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/t3?t=1787702704\" /></span>About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ResistanceZ</strong> is a co-op survival action horror game playable with up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players begin their fight for survival by parachuting from a plane onto a hostile island filled with enemies. From the moment you land, you must explore your surroundings and prepare for the dangers ahead. During loot phases, coordinating with your teammates to gather weapons, ammunition, and essential equipment is crucial for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real challenge begins when zombie waves arrive. As each wave grows increasingly difficult, you must build your defenses, manage your resources carefully, and protect one another. Without proper communication and teamwork, survival is impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only way off the island is a rescue helicopter. But until it arrives, you must hold your ground. Strengthen your defenses, secure your position, and survive until extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/488051701ec155a6008b7e63845d78d0.poster.avif?t=1787702704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/488051701ec155a6008b7e63845d78d0.webm?t=1787702704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/extras/488051701ec155a6008b7e63845d78d0.mp4?t=1787702704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "ResistanceZ is a co-op survival action horror game for up to four players, where teamwork is essential to survive against hordes of zombies and mutants. Fight off waves of enemies with your friends and stay alive!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/f69100e0f9154260b5ab2086309cb50a92f6819b/header.jpg?t=1787702704", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443830/6a5ccc8b00bacc40f3cd581f6f